TMUX CHEATSHEET
──────────────────────────────────────────────

WINDOWS
Ctrl+N              Next window
Ctrl+P              Previous window
Ctrl+b c            New window
Ctrl+b ,            Rename window

PANES
Shift+←              Left
Shift+→              Right
Shift+↑              Up
Shift+↓              Down
Ctrl+b %            Split horizontal
Ctrl+b "            Split vertical
Ctrl+b z            Zoom / unzoom

POPUPS
Ctrl+G              Temporary shell
Ctrl+/              Show this cheatsheet
Ctrl+D              Close temporary shell

OPERATIONS
Ctrl+b y            Toggle synchronize panes
Ctrl+b [            Copy / scroll mode
Ctrl+b r            Reload config

SESSIONS
Ctrl+b s            List sessions
Ctrl+b d            Detach
